(7259772, 1128762, 108580, '<td valign="top">DPC needs to see more of this type of "out there" imagery. We don''t explore our world enough. Whilst some may see the compo too central it really is in your face and a powerful POV. I''d like to have seen the cloud masked and underexposed somewhat. This would have added more drama to your image. In my minds eye that would have been more the way the scene presented itself. The camera has OE the sky in order to correctly expose the rest of the scene. Bracketing but in one shot. 7</td>', 'DPC needs to see more of this type of "out there" imagery. We don''t explore our world enough. Whilst some may see the compo too central it really is in your face and a powerful POV. I''d like to have seen the cloud masked and underexposed somewhat. This would have added more drama to your image. In my minds eye that would have been more the way the scene presented itself. The camera has OE the sky in order to correctly expose the rest of the scene. Bracketing but in one shot. 7', '2014-09-06 03:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
