(7259829, 1128358, 149964, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and I really like how the line of shore draws the eye to the horizon.</td>', 'Beautiful colours and I really like how the line of shore draws the eye to the horizon.', '2014-09-06 07:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259830, 1128876, 149964, '<td valign="top">A lovely subject and the sky is very beautiful. It''s a little over processed for my taste.</td>', 'A lovely subject and the sky is very beautiful. It''s a little over processed for my taste.', '2014-09-06 07:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259831, 1126671, 86218, '<td valign="top">Could this be a Dennis shot.. Lovely sharp and extremely difficult to get this Im sure. Should do very well and rooting for this to be Top 5 and even Ribbon. Just hope the voters can appreciate it for what it is and not grow blunt because of previous Sunbird shots as it can never be dull. Voted earlier</td>', 'Could this be a Dennis shot.. Lovely sharp and extremely difficult to get this Im sure. Should do very well and rooting for this to be Top 5 and even Ribbon. Just hope the voters can appreciate it for what it is and not grow blunt because of previous Sunbird shots as it can never be dull. Voted earlier', '2014-09-06 08:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259832, 1128775, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like this - good subject and works well in B&amp;W. Personally I find the leg in the lower right a little distracting.</td>', 'I like this - good subject and works well in B&W. Personally I find the leg in the lower right a little distracting.', '2014-09-06 08:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259833, 1128323, 86218, '<td valign="top">One of my highest votes and a lovely simple shot. Something like a cat in frame would further enhance this shot or some life form.. But it''s nice as it stands</td>', 'One of my highest votes and a lovely simple shot. Something like a cat in frame would further enhance this shot or some life form.. But it''s nice as it stands', '2014-09-06 08:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259834, 1128580, 149964, '<td valign="top">There''s so much in this I love. Even the barbed wire! I like the way the wire and the bird/post appear to be silhouetted against the backdrop. The contrasting lines of grass/fence and mountains work really well. I could go on....</td>', 'There''s so much in this I love. Even the barbed wire! I like the way the wire and the bird/post appear to be silhouetted against the backdrop. The contrasting lines of grass/fence and mountains work really well. I could go on....', '2014-09-06 08:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259835, 1128851, 149964, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours. Personally I''d have liked to have seem more of the steps/ramp as the handrails seem a little ''detached'' from the scene.</td>', 'Lovely colours. Personally I''d have liked to have seem more of the steps/ramp as the handrails seem a little ''detached'' from the scene.', '2014-09-06 08:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259836, 1128843, 149964, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft picture and lovely subject.</td>', 'Beautiful soft picture and lovely subject.', '2014-09-06 08:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259838, 1128828, 149964, '<td valign="top">Pretty subject.  I really like the angle at which it has been taken and the colour contrasts.</td>', 'Pretty subject.  I really like the angle at which it has been taken and the colour contrasts.', '2014-09-06 08:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259842, 1127789, 149964, '<td valign="top">Great motion capture! The tassels on the rider give it a real sense of movement (as does a mid-air animal of course!)</td>', 'Great motion capture! The tassels on the rider give it a real sense of movement (as does a mid-air animal of course!)', '2014-09-06 08:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259843, 1128362, 149964, '<td valign="top">Cutey! Gorgeous model and the lighting on  her brings out a real softness.This is one of my favourites.</td>', 'Cutey! Gorgeous model and the lighting on  her brings out a real softness.This is one of my favourites.', '2014-09-06 08:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259844, 1128508, 149964, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the head and I like the pastel setting.</td>', 'Great capture of the head and I like the pastel setting.', '2014-09-06 08:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259845, 1127754, 149964, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Beautiful light that highlights the horse and rider well.</td>', 'I really like this. Beautiful light that highlights the horse and rider well.', '2014-09-06 08:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259846, 1128327, 149964, '<td valign="top">I do love stars! A lovely dramatic capture of the milky way.</td>', 'I do love stars! A lovely dramatic capture of the milky way.', '2014-09-06 08:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259847, 1128549, 149964, '<td valign="top">I love the moodiness of the clouds in this and the contrast with the green. I think I may have preferred it if some of the foreground had been cropped as I think it detracts from the hill.</td>', 'I love the moodiness of the clouds in this and the contrast with the green. I think I may have preferred it if some of the foreground had been cropped as I think it detracts from the hill.', '2014-09-06 08:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259849, 1128588, 149964, '<td valign="top">I really like lighthouses and this is a lovely capture of one. I''d like to have seen a versions with a bit more sky above the lighthouse to see if it set it off better - but not at the expense of those imposing rocks!</td>', 'I really like lighthouses and this is a lovely capture of one. I''d like to have seen a versions with a bit more sky above the lighthouse to see if it set it off better - but not at the expense of those imposing rocks!', '2014-09-06 08:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259850, 1128690, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and subject very much. I think I''d have liked the front rocks to gave been a little sharper or given more contrast against the ones at the back.</td>', 'I like the colours and subject very much. I think I''d have liked the front rocks to gave been a little sharper or given more contrast against the ones at the back.', '2014-09-06 08:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259851, 1128217, 149964, '<td valign="top">B&amp; W works well with the and I really like the textures/markings that can be seen through the whole passageway,</td>', 'B& W works well with the and I really like the textures/markings that can be seen through the whole passageway,', '2014-09-06 08:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259852, 1128768, 149964, '<td valign="top">The graininess and light work really well on this. Like it.</td>', 'The graininess and light work really well on this. Like it.', '2014-09-06 08:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259853, 1128825, 149964, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset and silhouettes.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset and silhouettes.', '2014-09-06 08:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259854, 1128823, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like butterflies - and capturing this on something other than a flower adds a new dimension. Lovely and crisp and well framed.</td>', 'I like butterflies - and capturing this on something other than a flower adds a new dimension. Lovely and crisp and well framed.', '2014-09-06 08:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259857, 1128567, 149964, '<td valign="top">This is great. Captures the movements and flow really well and the contrasts really well against the black background. One of my favourites.</td>', 'This is great. Captures the movements and flow really well and the contrasts really well against the black background. One of my favourites.', '2014-09-06 08:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259858, 1128845, 149964, '<td valign="top">Or grumpy! Love this. Captures features, character and texture really well.</td>', 'Or grumpy! Love this. Captures features, character and texture really well.', '2014-09-06 08:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259859, 1127416, 149964, '<td valign="top">Good subject and I like colours and textures of the fur.  The eye doesn''t seem quite as sharp as the nose but that''s only a minor observation!</td>', 'Good subject and I like colours and textures of the fur.  The eye doesn''t seem quite as sharp as the nose but that''s only a minor observation!', '2014-09-06 08:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259860, 1128630, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like this street shot.</td>', 'Really like this street shot.', '2014-09-06 08:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259861, 1127537, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever capture and I like the framing. I thought the focus was a little soft for my taste.</td>', 'Clever capture and I like the framing. I thought the focus was a little soft for my taste.', '2014-09-06 08:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259862, 1128227, 149964, '<td valign="top">really like the clouds. Personally I''d have liked a little ''something'' else in the photograph to give it a sense of moment/focus.</td>', 'really like the clouds. Personally I''d have liked a little ''something'' else in the photograph to give it a sense of moment/focus.', '2014-09-06 08:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259863, 1128353, 149964, '<td valign="top">Love these bears.</td>', 'Love these bears.', '2014-09-06 08:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259864, 1128558, 149964, '<td valign="top">Fabulous colours but I''d have preferred a sharper focus.</td>', 'Fabulous colours but I''d have preferred a sharper focus.', '2014-09-06 08:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259865, 1128865, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like the perspective and contrasting colours. Think I''d have  liked the yellow plants on the left t have been a little sharper.</td>', 'Really like the perspective and contrasting colours. Think I''d have  liked the yellow plants on the left t have been a little sharper.', '2014-09-06 08:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259866, 1127605, 149964, '<td valign="top">Lovely balance of light, cloud and contrast. Figure adds ''life'' to the picture. Like this.</td>', 'Lovely balance of light, cloud and contrast. Figure adds ''life'' to the picture. Like this.', '2014-09-06 08:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259867, 1128875, 149964, '<td valign="top">Like the subject and framing but found the focus a little soft for my liking,</td>', 'Like the subject and framing but found the focus a little soft for my liking,', '2014-09-06 08:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259868, 1127223, 149964, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject and I really like the framing and B&amp;W setting.</td>', 'Lovely subject and I really like the framing and B&W setting.', '2014-09-06 08:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259894, 1128197, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and I like the angles.</td>', 'Clever idea and I like the angles.', '2014-09-06 12:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259896, 1128019, 149964, '<td valign="top">A beautiful landscape with some lovely light but I would have liked a specific feature/subject to lift it.</td>', 'A beautiful landscape with some lovely light but I would have liked a specific feature/subject to lift it.', '2014-09-06 12:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259897, 1128886, 149964, '<td valign="top">Good crisp lines.</td>', 'Good crisp lines.', '2014-09-06 12:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
