(7259933, 1128019, 76335, '<td valign="top">Too many landscapes here jump out at me with their over-the-top sharpness, HDR, etc. It''s refreshing to see one that does not attack me, but rather, invites me in. A ten for you.</td>', 'Too many landscapes here jump out at me with their over-the-top sharpness, HDR, etc. It''s refreshing to see one that does not attack me, but rather, invites me in. A ten for you.', '2014-09-06 13:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
