(7260729, 1128189, 96311, '<td valign="top">Woooohhoooooo thrilled to bits ! can''t believe finally got a blue in a freestudy :-D this has brought a few personal challenges together for me - to win a free study, set the highest score with the canon 450d, a new personal best :-) top 16 images taken with this lens :-) and of course its always absolutely mega to beat Hesitant in any challenge ;-P he doesn''t make that easy either !<br/>Thanks a lot for your votes and comments, chuffed to bits ! :-D<br/>Rob</td>', 'Woooohhoooooo thrilled to bits ! can''t believe finally got a blue in a freestudy :-D this has brought a few personal challenges together for me - to win a free study, set the highest score with the canon 450d, a new personal best :-) top 16 images taken with this lens :-) and of course its always absolutely mega to beat Hesitant in any challenge ;-P he doesn''t make that easy either !Thanks a lot for your votes and comments, chuffed to bits ! :-DRob', '2014-09-08 05:50:51.000000', NULL, 0),
