(7260832, 1128790, 112739, '<td valign="top">I meant to comment on this during voting but ran out of time. Congrats on TT. I thought it was so interesting to see all the bikes/cars/boats and not see only one person in the shot! Great work.</td>', 'I meant to comment on this during voting but ran out of time. Congrats on TT. I thought it was so interesting to see all the bikes/cars/boats and not see only one person in the shot! Great work.', '2014-09-08 11:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
