(7260865, 1128189, 46885, '<td valign="top">As a disgruntled fellow contestant I''d say, yes, nice, but so overdressed. It''s like you don''t trust the audience to accept a less glossy version of what, undoubtedly, is a very impressive scene.</td>', 'As a disgruntled fellow contestant I''d say, yes, nice, but so overdressed. It''s like you don''t trust the audience to accept a less glossy version of what, undoubtedly, is a very impressive scene.', '2014-09-08 12:47:52.000000', NULL, 0),
