(7261027, 1128189, 59029, '<td valign="top">Very nice image it is fun to ribbon, and win, with a camera you''re retiring!  Glad the sunset gods were with you.  Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'Very nice image it is fun to ribbon, and win, with a camera you''re retiring!  Glad the sunset gods were with you.  Congrats on the blue!', '2014-09-08 15:20:26.000000', NULL, 0),
