(7261225, 1128710, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> Very handsome old team, I wonder what their story is? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Don''t know anything about them. Just spotted them in a field when on holiday in France and just had to stop the car and take some photos. They looked magical!</td>', 'Originally posted by snaffles: Very handsome old team, I wonder what their story is?   Don''t know anything about them. Just spotted them in a field when on holiday in France and just had to stop the car and take some photos. They looked magical!', '2014-09-09 03:05:27.000000', NULL, 0),
