(7261303, 1127814, 12611, '<td valign="top">Wow. the beauty of the street snapshot is that the goal, some might say, is to first make it look easy. Next, make it look like a great deal of unlikely coincidences, meaningful glances and postures, and glorious details were put there by the photographer. To make it look easy and expertly crafted at the same time- you have accomplished that here splendidly.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-09-09 09:11:47.</i></td>', 'Wow. the beauty of the street snapshot is that the goal, some might say, is to first make it look easy. Next, make it look like a great deal of unlikely coincidences, meaningful glances and postures, and glorious details were put there by the photographer. To make it look easy and expertly crafted at the same time- you have accomplished that here splendidly.', '2014-09-09 10:11:08.000000', '2014-09-09 10:11:47.000000', 0),
(7261304, 1128540, 12611, '<td valign="top">Super smooth, and a nice viewpoint. very nice.</td>', 'Super smooth, and a nice viewpoint. very nice.', '2014-09-09 10:12:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7261305, 1128703, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, great mist.</td>', 'Nice colors, great mist.', '2014-09-09 10:13:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7261306, 1128680, 12611, '<td valign="top">Really nice detail. perhaps there is a bit of an imbalance of dark and light tones, or the crop is too tall. Perhaps black and white? (these are simply thoughts as to why it did not place top ten- still super nice.)</td>', 'Really nice detail. perhaps there is a bit of an imbalance of dark and light tones, or the crop is too tall. Perhaps black and white? (these are simply thoughts as to why it did not place top ten- still super nice.)', '2014-09-09 10:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7261307, 1126907, 16148, '<td valign="top">The mans posture and leaning clouds juxtaposed with the old pilings works well.  A little heavy on vignette for my taste but no big deal.   Your score is pretty decent but I''m surprised by the lack of comments.</td>', 'The mans posture and leaning clouds juxtaposed with the old pilings works well.  A little heavy on vignette for my taste but no big deal.   Your score is pretty decent but I''m surprised by the lack of comments.', '2014-09-09 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7261308, 1128891, 16148, '<td valign="top">Tom mentioned cropping off the right side but I''m not so sure.  I like your composition.  The red colors on the right side are what attract the eye.  Did you try b&amp;w?  Works well either way for me.  Love that reflection on the left edge.</td>', 'Tom mentioned cropping off the right side but I''m not so sure.  I like your composition.  The red colors on the right side are what attract the eye.  Did you try b&w?  Works well either way for me.  Love that reflection on the left edge.', '2014-09-09 10:28:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7261309, 1128527, 16148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and catch!</td>', 'Beautiful light and catch!', '2014-09-09 10:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7261310, 1128877, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great hair and shirt. The beauty of photography, at times, is that we forget the medium and just see the subject, but make no mistake, all because of the photographer. You do that here, we are lost in the lush read hair, warmth of flannel and rustic setting. Perhaps the only consideration is the fact that it is difficult to balance the beautiful softness of the portrait with what would have been super-to-see structure and detail on the wood.</td>', 'Great hair and shirt. The beauty of photography, at times, is that we forget the medium and just see the subject, but make no mistake, all because of the photographer. You do that here, we are lost in the lush read hair, warmth of flannel and rustic setting. Perhaps the only consideration is the fact that it is difficult to balance the beautiful softness of the portrait with what would have been super-to-see structure and detail on the wood.', '2014-09-09 10:30:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7261313, 1128874, 16148, '<td valign="top">It''s rare to see a monochrome rainbow.  Works well for this everyday scene.</td>', 'It''s rare to see a monochrome rainbow.  Works well for this everyday scene.', '2014-09-09 10:32:34.000000', NULL, 0),
